
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Royal Taste | Restaurant</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #fffaf2;
      color: #29251f;
    }
    header {
      background: #182820;
      color: white;
      padding: 22px 6%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    header h2 { margin: 0; color: #f1c878; }
    nav a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 14px;
    }
    .hero {
      min-height: 390px;
      padding: 65px 8%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #182820, #182820dd),
        url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517248135467-4c7edcad34c4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=80") center/cover;
      color: white;
    }
    .hero div { max-width: 600px; }
    .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(38px, 7vw, 64px); margin: 0 0 15px; }
    .hero p { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 13px 20px;
      background: #e8b95f;
      color: #182820;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }
    section { padding: 45px 7%; }
    .heading { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .heading h2 { font-size: 30px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .menu {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 22px;
    }
    .dish {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 18px #00000012;
    }
    .dish img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 190px;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
    }
    .dish div { padding: 17px; }
    .dish h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; }
    .price { color: #92702d; font-weight: bold; }
    .about {
      background: #efe8da;
      text-align: center;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }
    .contact { text-align: center; }
    footer {
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: center;
      background: #182820;
      color: white;
    }
    @media (max-width: 500px) {
      nav a { margin-left: 0; margin-right: 10px; }
      .hero { padding: 50px 7%; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h2>Royal Taste</h2>
    <nav>
      <a href="#home">Home</a>
      <a href="#menu">Menu</a>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="home">
      <div>
        <p>WELCOME TO ROYAL TASTE</p>
        <h1>Good Food.<br>Great Moments.</h1>
        <p>Fresh ingredients, delicious flavours and a warm
        welcome for every guest.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="#menu">Explore Our Menu</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="menu">
      <div class="heading">
        <h2>Our Popular Menu</h2>
        <p>Made with love, served fresh.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="menu">
        <article class="dish">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565299624946-b28f40a0ae38?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80" alt="Pizza">
          <div><h3>Classic Pizza</h3>
          <p>Cheesy, delicious and freshly baked.</p>
          <p class="price">LKR 1,500</p></div>
        </article>
        <article class="dish">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1568901346375-23c9450c58cd?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80" alt="Burger">
          <div><h3>Royal Burger</h3>
          <p>A juicy burger with fresh ingredients.</p>
          <p class="price">LKR 950</p></div>
        </article>
        <article class="dish">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1515003197210-e0cd7184f8b5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80" alt="Rice meal">
          <div><h3>Special Rice</h3>
          <p>A satisfying meal packed with flavour.</p>
          <p class="price">LKR 1,200</p></div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p style="text-align:center;font-size:13px">
        Demo menu and prices — replace with the restaurant's real details.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about" id="about">
      <div class="heading"><h2>Our Story</h2></div>
      <p>At Royal Taste, we believe great food brings people
      together. Visit us with your family and friends and
      make every meal a special memory.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="contact" id="contact">
      <div class="heading">
        <h2>Visit Us</h2>
        <p>We look forward to welcoming you!</p>
      </div>
      <p>Opening hours: 10:00 AM – 10:00 PM (demo)</p>
      <p>Location: Add restaurant address here</p>
      <a class="btn"
        href="https://wa.me/94770000000"
        target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        Contact on WhatsApp
      </a>
      <p style="font-size:13px">Replace the demo number with the owner's number.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2026 Royal Taste — Restaurant Website Demo</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
